icon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Iceland\" title=\"Iceland\"><img alt=\"Iceland\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ce/Flag_of_Iceland.svg/40px-Flag_of_Iceland.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"21\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ce/Flag_of_Iceland.svg/60px-Flag_of_Iceland.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1250\" data-file-height=\"900\" /></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Kolbeinn_%C3%9E%C3%B3r%C3%B0arson\" title=\"Kolbeinn Þórðarson\">Kolbeinn Þórðarson</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/IFK_G%C3%B6teborg\" title=\"IFK Göteborg\">Göteborg</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Norway\" title=\"Norway\"><img alt=\"Norway\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d9/Flag_of_Norway.svg/40px-Flag_of_Norway.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"21\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d9/Flag_of_Norway.svg/60px-Flag_of_Norway.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"372\" /></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Anders_Trondsen\" title=\"Anders Trondsen\">Anders Trondsen</a> (Göteborg)</li>\n<li><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ghana\" title=\"Ghana\"><img alt=\"Ghana\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/19/Flag_of_Ghana.svg/40px-Flag_of_Ghana.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/19/Flag_of_Ghana.svg/60px-Flag_of_Ghana.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"900\" data-file-height=\"600\" /></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Terry_Yegbe\" title=\"Terry Yegbe\">Terry Yegbe</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/IF_Elfsborg\" title=\"IF Elfsborg\">Elfsborg</a>)</li></ul></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"Club\">Club</h4><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2024_Allsvenskan&amp;action=edit&amp;section=16\" title=\"Edit section: Club\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li>Most yellow cards: <b>21</b><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-30\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-30\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>27<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Halmstads_BK\" title=\"Halmstads BK\">Halmstad</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<ul><li>Most red cards: <b>2</b><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-31\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-31\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>28<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/IF_Elfsborg\" title=\"IF Elfsborg\">Elfsborg</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/IFK_G%C3%B6teborg\" title=\"IFK Göteborg\">Göteborg</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Awards\">Awards</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2024_Allsvenskan&amp;action=edit&amp;section=17\" title=\"Edit section: Awards\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Allsvenskans_Stora_Pris\">Allsvenskans Stora Pris</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2024_Allsvenskan&amp;action=edit&amp;section=18\" title=\"Edit section: Allsvenskans Stora Pris\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>For the twelfth year running, the broadcaster of Allsvenskan, <a href=\"/wiki/Max_(streaming_service)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Max (streaming service)\">Max</a>, hosted an award ceremony where they presented seven awards and two special awards to the players and staff of the 16 Allsvenskan clubs, the award ceremony was held on 20 November 2024.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-32\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-32\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>29<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> The nominations for the 2024 season were officially announced on 15 November 2017.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-33\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-33\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>30<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Nominees are displayed below, the winners are marked in bold text. Hammarby IF received the most nominations with five nominations, while Malmö FF received five nominations, Djurgårdens and AIK received three nominations, IF Brommapojkarna received two nominations, IFK Göteborg, Mjällby AIF, Västerås SK and Gais each received one nomination.\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r1326026747\">@media all and (max-width:720px){.mw-parser-output .multicol-float{float:none!important;width:auto!important;min-width:auto!important}}.mw-parser-output .multicol-float{clear:none;float:left}.mw-parser-output .multicol-float-clear{clear:both}</style><div class=\"multicol-float\" style=\"min-width: 22em;\">\n<p><b>Goalkeeper of the year</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><b><a href=\"/wiki/Warner_Hahn\" title=\"Warner Hahn\">Warner Hahn</a></b> (Hammarby IF)</li>\n<li><small><a href=\"/wiki/Jacob_Widell_Zetterstr%C3%B6m\" title=\"Jacob Widell Zetterström\">Jacob Widell Zetterström</a> (Djurgårdens IF)</small></li>\n<li><small><a href=\"/wiki/Johan_Dahlin\" title=\"Johan Dahlin\">Johan Dahlin</a> (Malmö FF)</small></li></ul>\n</div><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1326026747\" /><div class=\"multicol-float\" style=\"min-width: 22em;\">\n<p><b>Defender of the year</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><b><a href=\"/wiki/Pontus_Jansson\" title=\"Pontus Jansson\">Pontus Jansson</a></b> (Malmö FF)</li>\n<li><small><a href=\"/wiki/Shaquille_Pinas\" title=\"Shaquille Pinas\">Shaquille Pinas</a> (Hammarby IF)</small></li>\n<li><small><a href=\"/wiki/Elliot_Stroud\" title=\"Elliot Stroud\">Elliot Stroud</a> (Mjällby AIF)</small></li></ul>\n</div><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1326026747\" /><div class=\"multicol-float\" style=\"min-width: 22em;\">\n<p><b>Midfielder of the year</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><b><a href=\"/wiki/Sebastian_Nanasi\" title=\"Sebastian Nanasi\">Sebastian Nanasi</a></b> (Malmö FF)</li>\n<li><small><a href=\"/wiki/Anton_Sal%C3%A9tros\" title=\"Anton Salétros\">Anton Salétros</a> (AIK)</small></li>\n<li><small><a href=\"/wiki/Nahir_Besara\" title=\"Nahir Besara\">Nahir Besara</a> (Hammarby IF)</small></li></ul>\n</div><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1326026747\" /><div class=\"multicol-float\" style=\"min-width: 22em;\">\n<p><b>Forward of the year</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><b><a href=\"/wiki/Nikola_Vasi%C4%87_(footballer)\" title=\"Nikola Vasić (footballer)\">Nikola Vasić</a></b> (IF Brommapojkarna)</li>\n<li><small><a href=\"/wiki/Deniz_H%C3%BCmmet\" title=\"Deniz Hümmet\">Deniz Hümmet</a> (Djurgårdens IF)</small></li>\n<li><small><a href=\"/wiki/Isaac_Kiese_Thelin\" title=\"Isaac Kiese Thelin\">Isaac Kiese Thelin</a> (Malmö FF)</small></li></ul>\n</div><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1326026747\" /><div class=\"multicol-float\" style=\"min-width: 22em;\">\n<p><b>Newcomer of the year</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><b><a href=\"/wiki/Samuel_Dahl\" title=\"Samuel Dahl\">Samuel Dahl</a></b> (Djurgårdens IF)</li>\n<li><small><a href=\"/wiki/Lamine_Fanne\" title=\"Lamine Fanne\">Lamine Fanne</a> (AIK)</small></li>\n<li><small><a href=\"/wiki/Marcus_Linday\" title=\"Marcus Linday\">Marcus Linday</a> (Västerås SK)</small></li></ul>\n</div><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1326026747\" /><div class=\"multicol-float\" style=\"min-width: 22em;\">\n<p><b>Manager of the year</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><b><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fredrik_Holmberg&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Fredrik Holmberg (page does not exist)\">Fredrik Holmberg</a></b> (GAIS)</li>\n<li><small><a href=\"/wiki/Mikkjal_Thomassen\" title=\"Mikkjal Thomassen\">Mikkjal Thomassen</a> (AIK)</small></li>\n<li><small><a href=\"/wiki/Kim_Hellberg\" title=\"Kim Hellberg\">Kim Hellberg</a> (Hammarby IF)</small></li></ul>\n</div><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1326026747\" /><div class=\"multicol-float\" style=\"min-width: 22em;\">\n<p><b>Most valuable player of the year</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><b><a href=\"/wiki/Sebastian_Nanasi\" title=\"Sebastian Nanasi\">Sebastian Nanasi</a></b> (Malmö FF)</li>\n<li><small><a href=\"/wiki/Nahir_Besara\" title=\"Nahir Besara\">Nahir Besara</a> (Hammarby IF)</small></li>\n<li><small><a href=\"/wiki/Nikola_Vasi%C4%87_(footballer)\" title=\"Nikola Vasić (footballer)\">Nikola Vasić</a> (IF Brommapojkarna)</small></li></ul>\n</div><div class=\"multicol-float-clear\" style=\"\"></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Player_of_the_Month_award\">Player of the Month award</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2024_Allsvenskan&amp;action=edit&amp;section=19\" title=\"Edit section: Player of the Month award\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th rowspan=\"2\">Month\n</th>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Player of the Month\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Player</th>\n<th>Club\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>April\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sweden\" title=\"Sweden\"><img alt=\"Sweden\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/40px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/60px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1600\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sebastian_Nanasi\" title=\"Sebastian Nanasi\">Sebastian Nanasi</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Malm%C3%B6_FF\" title=\"Malmö FF\">Malmö FF</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>May\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sweden\" title=\"Sweden\"><img alt=\"Sweden\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/40px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/60px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1600\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Axel_Henriksson\" title=\"Axel Henriksson\">Axel Henriksson</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/GAIS\" title=\"GAIS\">GAIS</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>June\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" data-sort-value=\"\" style=\"background: var(--background-color-interactive, #ececec); color: var(--color-base, inherit); vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;\" class=\"table-na\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">—</span><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r1152813436\">.mw-parser-output .sr-only{border:0;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);clip-path:polygon(0px 0px,0px 0px,0px 0px);height:1px;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;padding:0;position:absolute;width:1px;white-space:nowrap}</style><span class=\"sr-only\">N/a</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>July\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sweden\" title=\"Sweden\"><img alt=\"Sweden\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/40px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/60px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1600\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gustav_Lundgren_(footballer)\" title=\"Gustav Lundgren (footballer)\">Gustav Lundgren</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/GAIS\" title=\"GAIS\">GAIS</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>August\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sweden\" title=\"Sweden\"><img alt=\"Sweden\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/40px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/60px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1600\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hugo_Bolin\" title=\"Hugo Bolin\">Hugo Bolin</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Malm%C3%B6_FF\" title=\"Malmö FF\">Malmö FF</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>September\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sweden\" title=\"Sweden\"><img alt=\"Sweden\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/40px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/60px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1600\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gustav_Lundgren_(footballer)\" title=\"Gustav Lundgren (footballer)\">Gustav Lundgren</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/GAIS\" title=\"GAIS\">GAIS</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>October\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sweden\" title=\"Sweden\"><img alt=\"Sweden\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/40px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/60px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1600\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nahir_Besara\" title=\"Nahir Besara\">Nahir Besara</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Hammarby_Fotboll\" title=\"Hammarby Fotboll\">Hammarby IF</a>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Coach_of_the_Month_award\">Coach of the Month award</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2024_Allsvenskan&amp;action=edit&amp;section=20\" title=\"Edit section: Coach of the Month award\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th rowspan=\"2\">Month\n</th>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Coach of the Month\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Player</th>\n<th>Club\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>April\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sweden\" title=\"Sweden\"><img alt=\"Sweden\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/40px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/60px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1600\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Henrik_Rydstr%C3%B6m\" title=\"Henrik Rydström\">Henrik Rydström</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Malm%C3%B6_FF\" title=\"Malmö FF\">Malmö FF</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>May\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sweden\" title=\"Sweden\"><img alt=\"Sweden\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/40px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/60px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1600\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></a></span></span> <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fredrik_Holmberg&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Fredrik Holmberg (page does not exist)\">Fredrik Holmberg</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/GAIS\" title=\"GAIS\">GAIS</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>June\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" data-sort-value=\"\" style=\"background: var(--background-color-interactive, #ececec); color: var(--color-base, inherit); vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;\" class=\"table-na\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">—</span><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1152813436\" /><span class=\"sr-only\">N/a</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>July\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sweden\" title=\"Sweden\"><img alt=\"Sweden\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/40px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/60px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1600\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Oscar_Hiljemark\" title=\"Oscar Hiljemark\">Oscar Hiljemark</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/IF_Elfsborg\" title=\"IF Elfsborg\">IF Elfsborg</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>August\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Faroe_Islands\" title=\"Faroe Islands\"><img alt=\"Faroe Islands\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Flag_of_the_Faroe_Islands.svg/40px-Flag_of_the_Faroe_Islands.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"21\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Flag_of_the_Faroe_Islands.svg/60px-Flag_of_the_Faroe_Islands.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1100\" data-file-height=\"800\" /></a></s